ional).\r\n\r\nTo access and use ysos you must be at least 18 years and comply with our Privacy Policy Terms and Conditions.\r\n\r\nMore information on the links:\r\nhttps://ysosapp.com/privacy-policy/\r\nhttps://ysosapp.com/terms/\r\n\r\nTop cities where ysos is used the most in US: New York, Los Angeles, Dallas, Houston, Miami, Florida, Philadelphia, Boston, Atlanta, Las Vegas, San Antonio, San Diego, San Francisco.\r\n\r\nDo you have any questions or suggestions to make ysos even better? \r\nOur experts will be happy to help you with whatever you need. To contact us, please send an email to: suporte@ysosapp.com.br",
    "descriptionHTML": "ysos is the dating app for open-minded singles and couples near you, who match your preferences to have fun the way you always wanted. Whether it\u2019s a casual date or open relationships, ysos is a discreet and secure dating app that allows you to find out if there is an affinity with other profiles nearby according to your interests! Whether you are a straight swinger, gay, lesbian, bisexual, pansexual or transgender, ysos it is for you!<br><br>Practicality to have a safe date<br>how ysos works: When registering your account, tell us a little about yourself and who you are looking for. Complete your information and mind your  description to stand out. You will meet interesting people nearby and find out if you are have chemistry. when you have a mutual like, the chat is released so you can get to know each other better!<br><br>Real people online!<br>Search for real singles and couples close to you and start a chat to ensure the best experiences when you meet. At ysos, we verify the cell phone number when creating the account to avoid fake profiles. You&#39;ll find real like-minded people for rendezvous! We&#39;re the official free swingers app!<br><br>Say goodbye to unwanted contacts with interest filters<br>You choose which profiles you want to relate to and only those who interest you will be able to chat and meet you.<br><br>Messages unblocked!<br>Chat without having to be a subscriber! If you like a profile and get liked back, send unlimited private messages for FREE.<br><br>More control and privacy for your photos.<br>You decide who can see your private photos. Uploaded images have an extra layer of watermarked security.<br><br>Secrecy and Discretion<br>Screen Lock (PIN) allows only you to access the app, keeping its content secret. Thus, your private photos and your account are in a safe environment.<br><br>ysos is free to register and use. But you can get access to some exclusive benefits and additional features by subscribing to ys